Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; TNXK0O~C (Operation G.H.O.S.T., export build): the same registry entry as patches/OG/data/wmv-asyncreader.reg. The title
; scene plays scene/title/og_title_movie_en.wmv through DirectShow; .wmv goes through the plain file source (AsyncReader) and
; the GStreamer splitter instead of Proton's WM ASF reader (qasf), which hung on graph Stop for Operation G.H.O.S.T.
; (2026-10-15). Imported by rg-direct with "wine reg import ... /reg:32" ([Launch] Registry, docs/registry.md).

[HKEY_CLASSES_ROOT\Media Type\Extensions\.wmv]
"Source Filter"="{e436ebb5-524f-11ce-9f53-0020af0ba770}"
"Media Type"="{e436eb83-524f-11ce-9f53-0020af0ba770}"
"Subtype"="{6b6d0801-9ada-11d0-a520-00a0d10129c0}"
